---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Disclaimer | Findable Home"
    description="Read the Findable Home disclaimer covering household advice, product information, safety, third-party links, and limitations of responsibility."
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200/40">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
                        OUR POLICIES
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-5xl">
                        Disclaimer
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70">
                        Important information about using our household
                        guidance, evaluating products, and making decisions
                        for your own home.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/70">
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Effective: October 10, 2026</span>
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Updated: October 10, 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
            <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
                <nav aria-label="Disclaimer contents" class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold">On this page</h2>
                    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#general">1. General information</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#accuracy">2. Accuracy and updates</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#household">3. Household solutions</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#safety">4. Safety and responsibility</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#products">5. Product information</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#affiliates">6. Affiliate relationships</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#third-parties">7. Third-party websites</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#results">8. Individual results</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#liability">9. Limitations</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#changes">10. Changes to this disclaimer</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#contact">11. Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </aside>

            <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 text-base-content">
                <section id="general" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 border-l-4 border-l-primary bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">1. General Information</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        The content published by Findable Home at
                        <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                        is intended for general informational and educational purposes.
                        We share practical ideas related to home organization,
                        storage, small-space living, renter-friendly solutions,
                        product research, and everyday household challenges.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Our content is intended to help readers explore possible
                        solutions. It is not a guarantee that a particular
                        method, product, or recommendation will suit every home
                        or circumstance.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="accuracy" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">2. Accuracy and Updates</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We aim to make our content useful, clear, and accurate.
                        However, information may become outdated, incomplete,
                        or affected by changes outside our control. We cannot
                        guarantee that every page is free from errors or that
                        all information is current at the time you read it.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Product details, prices, measurements, materials,
                        availability, retailer policies, and other information
                        may change. Where a decision depends on current details,
                        verify them with the relevant retailer, manufacturer,
                        or qualified source.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        If you notice an apparent error or outdated information,
                        you can contact us so we can review it.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="household" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">3. Household Solutions and Practical Guidance</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Household guidance is general and may need to be adapted
                        to your space, materials, budget, rental agreement,
                        accessibility needs, and personal circumstances.
                        Homes differ in layout, construction, dimensions,
                        ventilation, surfaces, and existing fixtures.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Before applying a suggestion, consider whether it is
                        appropriate for your setting. Check measurements,
                        product instructions, installation requirements,
                        surface compatibility, and any applicable rental
                        restrictions.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Content on Findable Home is not a substitute for
                        professional assessment when your circumstances
                        require specialized knowledge.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="safety" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">4. Safety and Personal Responsibility</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        You are responsible for determining whether a product,
                        installation method, storage arrangement, cleaning
                        approach, or other household solution is safe and
                        suitable for your circumstances.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Follow manufacturers' instructions, weight limits,
                        warnings, and applicable safety guidance. Adhesive
                        products, wall-mounted storage, shelving, and hanging
                        systems can behave differently depending on the
                        surface, preparation, environment, load, and duration
                        of use. A renter-friendly label does not guarantee
                        damage-free removal or suitability for every surface.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Do not rely on general online content for hazardous
                        electrical work, structural modifications, heavy-load
                        installations, or other work requiring specialized
                        expertise. Seek a qualified professional when appropriate.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Nothing in this Disclaimer is intended to exclude
                        responsibility where applicable law does not allow
                        that exclusion.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="products" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">5. Product Information and Purchasing Decisions</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may discuss or link to products sold by
                        independent retailers and manufacturers. Unless
                        explicitly stated, we are not the manufacturer or
                        seller of those products.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We cannot guarantee product quality, performance,
                        compatibility, durability, availability, shipping,
                        customer service, warranty coverage, or suitability
                        for a particular purpose. We do not guarantee that
                        every product discussed has been personally purchased
                        or tested.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Before buying, verify current dimensions, materials,
                        installation requirements, weight limits, compatibility,
                        price, shipping costs, return conditions, and warranty
                        details directly with the seller or manufacturer.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Your purchase decision and any transaction with a
                        third-party seller are your responsibility, subject
                        to any rights you have under applicable law.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="affiliates" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">6. Affiliate Relationships and Compensation</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Some links on Findable Home may be affiliate links.
                        We may earn a commission when a qualifying purchase
                        or action occurs through such a link. The availability
                        and amount of compensation depend on the relevant
                        program and its terms.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Affiliate compensation does not establish that a
                        product is the best option for every reader. We aim
                        to keep recommendations focused on household needs
                        and practical suitability.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        For more details about these relationships, please
                        read our
                        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="link link-primary">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="third-parties" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">7. Third-Party Websites and Services</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Our website may link to external retailers,
                        manufacturers, product-curation platforms, social
                        platforms, and other services. These links are
                        provided for convenience and further information.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We do not control or guarantee the content, accuracy,
                        availability, security, products, services, policies,
                        or privacy practices of third-party websites. A link
                        does not necessarily mean that Findable Home endorses
                        the external website or everything it offers.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Review the relevant provider's terms, privacy policy,
                        and purchasing conditions before interacting with it.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="results" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">8. Individual Results May Vary</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Organization methods, storage products, and household
                        routines can produce different results depending on
                        the space, items being stored, frequency of use,
                        maintenance, personal preferences, and other factors.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We do not promise specific results, savings, improved
                        functionality, damage-free installation, or a
                        particular outcome from using any recommendation.
                        Examples and illustrations are intended to explain
                        ideas, not guarantee a result in your home.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="liability" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">9. Limitations of Responsibility</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law,
                        Findable Home and its operator disclaim liability
                        for losses or damages arising from reliance on
                        general website information, use of a suggested
                        household method, purchase or use of a third-party
                        product, or interaction with an external website.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        This statement does not override the Terms &amp;
                        Conditions or remove any rights or liabilities that
                        cannot legally be excluded or limited.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        For the broader terms governing use of the website,
                        please see our
                        <a href="/terms/" class="link link-primary">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="changes" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">10. Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We may revise this Disclaimer as our website, content,
                        services, or practices change. The current version
                        will be published on this page with an updated
                        "Last Updated" date. We encourage you to review it
                        periodically.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-1.5 bg-primary"></div>
                    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Need clarification?</span>
                        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">11. Contact Us</h2>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                            If you have a question about this Disclaimer or
                            notice potentially inaccurate information, please
                            contact Findable Home.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5">
                            <p class="font-bold">Findable Home</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Email us at</p>
                            <a href="mailto:contact@findablehome.me" class="mt-1 inline-block break-all font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">
                                contact@findablehome.me
                            </a>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
                                <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <p class="px-1 py-3 text-center text-sm text-base-content/60">
                    Findable Home aims to make household information practical, clear, and responsible.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

